[bg  time="4000"  method="crossfade"  storage="_pc_room_4.jpg"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
(It's morning... Haven't slept a wink after watching the new couple in Room 205.)[p]
(Who'd have thought they'd be going at it up 'til dawn?)[p]
(All right, I'd better head out.)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[playbgm  volume="100"  time="3000"  loop="true"  storage="nitijyou.mp3"  fadein="true"  ]
[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="back_mansyonmae.jpg"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
I've had countless mornings like this.[p]
After waking up, I washed my face, changed clothes, and went out to clean the condo.[p]
Woman "Good morning, Sir."[p]
Shinya "Oh, good morning. Have a great day."[p]
Woman "I'm off!"[p]
Kid "Bye bye, Mister!"[p]
Shinya "Bye bye. You take care now."[p]
I saw the residents off with a smile.[p]
(Uhh, so today I have to check the garbage collection area... then change out the light in the stairwell.)[p]
(Well, I can get it all done by morning. Guess I can check out the electronics shops in the afternoon.)[p]
It was back to the daily grind for me as usual, as this condominium's landlord.[p]
A triple-whammy of the same work, the same routine, and the same scenery.[p]
But there was one thing I could look forward to.[p]
Employee "Good morning Sir. Up early today, I see."[p]
Shinya "Oh, good morning. Room 205... Mr. Arafuji!"[p]
Employee "You already remember my name? I'm flattered."[p]
Shinya "Of course. How is it living here?"[p]
Employee "Oh it's great! My wife loves it too. It feels like we've gotten even closer ever since we moved in."[p]
Shinya "That's great to hear. If you ever have any problems, please let me know."[p]
Shinya "Everyone has been so nice that I doubt there'll be any trouble with noise or the garbage though."[p]
Employee "Yes... Honestly, I'm more worried that my wife or I might be causing trouble with how loud we can get."[p]
Shinya "Oh? Do you fight? You seem really close though."[p]
Employee "No err, I'd say it's quite the opposite..."[p]
(Right. Of course you’d be worried about the noise, when you’re howling mid-sex.)[p]
(But the soundproofing in the building is top notch, so I doubt there'll be any trouble.)[p]
(The only one hearing it would be me, when I'm watching your room.)[p]
Shinya "Haha, it's fine. Whenever the conversation gets lively, I doubt anyone else can hear it."[p]
Employee "T-That's good to know. Anyway, I've got to get going."[p]
Shinya "Take care!"[p]
I saw Mr. Arafuji off, his cheeks a little pink.[p]
(He could've just asked outright -- whether they were too loud having sex.)[p]
I looked up at the 2nd floor corner room where the Arafujis moved in.[p]
I bet his hot wife's still up there... She was so sexy, grinding her hips cowgirl style last night.[p]
(Well, I recorded so I might as well watch it again and jack off.)[p]
My only oasis from the tedium of life were my secret surveillance videos and recordings of the residents.[p]
I lost both my parents when I was 20 and inherited this amazing condominium in the heart of the city.[p]
As the building's landlord, I handled the residents' issues and made more than enough monthly income from their rent.[p]
I had no trouble when it came to a livelihood, but there was something missing...[p]
I got tired of my daily life, so I suddenly felt like taking a peek into the lives of other people.[p]
(It's hilarious. His wife is so meek outside, but she was swinging her hips so intensely.)[p]
(Looks like I can enjoy this a little more... And if I get bored, I can just grab the cameras when the two of them head out.)[p]
I could peek into people's private conversations and sex lives.[p]
I got obsessed with it, to the point that whenever someone moving in piqued my interest, I'd immediately install hidden cameras in their room.[p]
(I know this is a crime... but I just can't stop.)[p]
I swept the garbage into the dustpan and tossed out the garbage bags.[p]
(Oh right... There should be a girl moving in today.)[p]
(I should check it out when I head back to my room...)[p]
After making a show of cleaning, I returned the tools and went back to my room.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[bg  time="1000"  method="fadeIn"  storage="_pc_room_4.jpg"  ]
[bg  time="1000"  method="fadeIn"  storage="event_OP_0.jpg"  ]
[tb_cg  id="cg1"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
(Oh yeah, looks like she's moving in today.)[p]
(But the keys were already handed over through the agent and the paperwork's all done. Guess there's nothing left for me to do.)[p]
("Hiiragi Yume" -- just graduated from university? Which means she's 22 this year.)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[call  storage="statusUP.ks"  target="*purofiru_kaihou"  ]
[tb_eval  exp="sf.Sunday_P_pro_1=1"  name="Sunday_P_pro_1"  cmd="="  op="t"  val="1"  val_2="undefined"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
(Guess she moved to Tokyo for work... But to start with a downtown condo? Her parents must be loaded.)[p]
(Sure hope she isn't a bitch to deal with... Well if she is, I'll just come up with some excuse to kick her out.)[playse storage="bell.mp3"] [p]
Shinya "Who is it this early in the morning...?"[p]
Shinya "Okay, I'm coming!"[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="0"  storage="dooropen.mp3"  ]
[bg  time="1000"  method="fadeIn"  storage="event_OP_1.jpg"  ]
[tb_cg  id="cg2"  ]
[playbgm  volume="100"  time="1000"  loop="true"  storage="yume.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
My hand froze still after opening the door.[p]
(Who is this girl? She's so damn cute...!)[p]
Her hair was raven black; skin porcelain white; with such big eyes. Her face looks innocent -- just what guys love. And her massive breasts were out of place on a frame as small as hers.[p]
#由芽
Yume "U-Um... Nice to meet you, I'm moving in today. My name is Hiiragi Yume."[p]
#
(So she's the one...!)[p]
#由芽
Yume "The agent told me that the landlord was living here."[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_text mode=4 ]
#由芽
Yume "U-Umm... I hope we can get along. And here, just a simple gift."
[_tb_end_text]

