[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#
Shinya "I'm the landlord, Yoshitani Shinya. If you ever have any problems, feel free to ask."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Thank you... I'm so lost because this my first time living alone, so I'm grateful for the help."[p]
#由芽
Yume "What I know are off limits are cleaning and doing the laundry at night, playing music... and slamming the door too loudly..."[p]
#由芽
Yume "I-Is there anything else?! If there's anything that would be a problem, please tell me!"[p]
#
Shinya "Pfft, hahaha! It's all right. As long as you go with common sense dictates, no one will make any complaints."[p]
#
Shinya "Plus, the soundproofing here is really good so it's all right to make a little noise."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Really? What a relief..."[p]
(Dang. This girl can be pretty jumpy, but she's super cute.)[p]
#由芽
Yume "I'm glad you're such a nice person. I was worried that you'd be more like an older guy."[p]
#
Shinya "I pretty much am, at least compared to you Ms. Hiiragi."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Oh not at all. You're more like a nice older brother."[p]
#由芽
Yume "I hope we can get along well from now on."[p]
#
Shinya "Yes, likewise. Let's make it a good one."[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[bg  time="1000"  method="fadeIn"  storage="black.jpg"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
She bowed ever so slightly and gently closed the door.[p]
I listened to the sound of her heels growing distant and thanked God.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[bg  time="1000"  method="fadeIn"  storage="_pc_room_4.jpg"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
(She's a little rough around the edges, but her face is top class. I didn't expect such a cute girl!)[p]
(Hiiragi Yume, eh...?)[p]
(I'm gonna keep a real close eye on her life, it looks like.)[p]
I grabbed her room's master key from the safe and placed it on my desk.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

