[bg  time="1000"  method="fadeIn"  storage="back_mansyonrouka.jpg"  ]
[chara_show  name="chara_yume"  time="1000"  wait="true"  storage="chara/121/adv_yume_def.gif"  width="1011"  height="1011"  left="142"  top="-1"  reflect="false"  ]
[playbgm  volume="100"  time="1000"  loop="true"  storage="yume.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#由芽
Yume "Oh, good morning Sir."[p]
Shinya "Ms. Hiiragi! Good morning."[p]
#由芽
Yume "I'm going out to do some groceries. Umm, is there anyplace nearby where I can buy detergent for cheap?"[p]
Shinya "Hmm... The discount store just across the station might be a good place to check."[p]
Shinya "There's also a drugstore on this side of the station, but the prices are a little high."[p]
#由芽
Yume "I see. I don't have much on me, so I'd appreciate the cheaper price."[p]
Shinya "On the 6th floor of the discount store, there's a section for daily sundries. That's where you'll want to check."[p]
Shinya "There's also a great cafe just nearby. Why don't you have a look there as well? I highly recommend their chocolate croissants."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Wow, that sounds delicious! I'll definitely take a look. Thank you very much!"[p]
Shinya "Take care!"[p]
#由芽
Yume "I'm off!"[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_hide  name="chara_yume"  time="1000"  wait="false"  pos_mode="false"  ]
[stopbgm  time="1000"  fadeout="true"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
After watching her walk away with a skip in her step, my lips curled into a smile.[p]
(That cafe is actually a good ways off, and it gets packed in the mornings.)[p]
(That means she won't be back 'til past noon... It's now or never!)[p]
I stood before Yume's room, its master key and a camera in hand.[p]
(All right... I wonder how our lovely little lady's room is like?)[p]
I turned the key and opened the door. I'm so used to it, I wasn't guilty or anxious in the slightest.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

