[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#由芽
Yume "Yeah, I'm fine. I'm already done moving in."[p]
#由芽
Yume "The landlord? I introduced myself. He seemed like a nice person."[p]
#由芽
Yume "I went around the stores in the neighborhood and did some shopping today."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Geez, you're such a worrywart mom! I'm already 22! And besides, Rei lives just nearby, so I'll be fine."[p]
(She's on a call... with her mom it looks like.)[p]
#由芽
Yume "Yeah, I'll text you if anything comes up. And I'll make sure to call too."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Okay, see you."[p]
(I bet she's lived a pretty sheltered life, with how well her parents take care of her...)[p]
(Heck, maybe that means she's never even had a relationship before?)[p]
(Time to keep a real close eye on her then.)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

